<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="el">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
  <title>Κατάσταση συστήματος — CHANTER Platform</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/platform/platform.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="shell">
    <%- include('_platform-nav', { active: locals.active || '' }) %>

    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/platform">Πλατφόρμα</a> / Κατάσταση</div>
    <h1 class="page-title">Κατάσταση συστήματος</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">
      Μία μετρημένη ένδειξη αποθήκευσης και μία σταθερή εγγύηση έγκρισης. Ό,τι δεν μετριέται, δηλώνεται ως άγνωστο.
      &middot; One measured storage signal and one fixed approval guarantee. Anything unmeasured is reported as unknown.
    </p>

    <div class="health-grid" data-testid="health-grid">
      <div class="panel health-card" data-health="storage">
        <div class="health-head">
          <div class="health-name">Αποθήκευση &middot; Storage</div>
          <span class="chip <%= health.storage.reachable === true ? 'chip-ready' : (health.storage.reachable === false ? 'chip-failed' : 'chip-neutral') %>">
            <%= health.storage.reachable === true ? 'Προσβάσιμη' : (health.storage.reachable === false ? 'Μη προσβάσιμη' : 'Άγνωστη') %>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="health-detail">
          Πάροχος: <%= health.storage.provider %> &middot; λειτουργία: <%= health.storage.mode %>
        </div>
        <div class="health-detail-en">Provider: <%= health.storage.provider %> &middot; mode: <%= health.storage.mode %></div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel health-card" data-health="approval">
        <div class="health-head">
          <div class="health-name">Έγκριση &middot; Approval</div>
          <span class="chip chip-ready">Υποχρεωτική</span>
        </div>
        <div class="health-detail">Καμία δημοσίευση δεν προγραμματίζεται χωρίς ανθρώπινη έγκριση.</div>
        <div class="health-detail-en">Nothing is scheduled without human approval.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel health-card" data-health="modules">
        <div class="health-head">
          <div class="health-name">Ενότητες &middot; Modules</div>
          <span class="chip chip-neutral"><%= customerModuleCount %> + <%= internalModuleCount %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="health-detail"><%= customerModuleCount %> ενεργές για εσάς, <%= internalModuleCount %> εσωτερικές.</div>
        <div class="health-detail-en"><%= customerModuleCount %> active for you, <%= internalModuleCount %> internal.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel health-card" data-health="work">
        <div class="health-head">
          <div class="health-name">Εργασίες &middot; Work</div>
          <span class="chip <%= workError ? 'chip-failed' : 'chip-neutral' %>"><%= workError ? 'Άγνωστες' : workSummary.total %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="health-detail">
          <% if (workError) { %>
            Δεν ήταν δυνατή η ανάγνωση των εργασιών.
          <% } else { %>
            <%= workSummary.running %> σε εξέλιξη, <%= workSummary.awaitingApproval %> σε αναμονή έγκρισης, <%= workSummary.failed %> με αποτυχία.
          <% } %>
        </div>
        <div class="health-detail-en">
          <% if (workError) { %><%= workError %><% } else { %>
            <%= workSummary.running %> running, <%= workSummary.awaitingApproval %> waiting for approval, <%= workSummary.failed %> failed.
          <% } %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="section-note" style="margin-top:18px" data-testid="health-observed-at">
      Μέτρηση: <%= health.observedAt %> &middot; observed at <%= health.observedAt %>
    </p>

    <p class="footer-note">
      Η ετοιμότητα εκτέλεσης, τα workers και η κατάσταση deployment παρακολουθούνται εσωτερικά στο Operator και δεν δηλώνονται εδώ.
      &middot; Runtime readiness, workers and deployment status are tracked internally in Operator and are not claimed here.
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
